 "Soul Point Bombs": "靈魂點數炸彈",
 "Throw a crazy party around you! Music will start playing and mobs will dance. Bombs are consumed upon use.": "在你身邊開一場瘋狂派對！音樂會響起，怪物會跟著跳舞。炸彈使用後即消耗。",
 "Send {~} random Ingredients to every player on your world. Bombs are consumed upon use.": "向你所在世界的每一位玩家送出 {~} 份隨機素材。炸彈使用後即消耗。",
 "Restore {~} Charges to the Teleportation Scrolls of every player on your world. Bombs are consumed upon use.": "為你所在世界每一位玩家的傳送卷軸回復 {~} 次使用次數。炸彈使用後即消耗。",
 "Activates all regular World Events on your world. Bombs are consumed upon use.": "啟動你所在世界的所有常態世界事件。炸彈使用後即消耗。",
 "Increase the amount of Loot in every Loot Chest on your world for {~} minutes. Bombs are consumed upon use.": "在 {~} 分鐘內，提高你所在世界每一個寶箱的戰利品數量。炸彈使用後即消耗。",
 "Give free entry to all Dungeons on your world for {~} minutes. Bombs are consumed upon use.": "在 {~} 分鐘內，你所在世界的所有地城都可免費進入。炸彈使用後即消耗。",
 "Send a filled Loot Chest's worth of items to every player on your world. Bombs are consumed upon use.": "向你所在世界的每一位玩家送出相當於一整箱寶箱的物品。炸彈使用後即消耗。",
 "Double all loot dropped by mobs in your world for {~} minutes. Bombs are consumed upon use.": "在 {~} 分鐘內，你所在世界的怪物掉落全部加倍。炸彈使用後即消耗。",
 "Send a message to every player online on Wynncraft. Bombs are consumed upon use.": "向 Wynncraft 上每一位在線玩家送出一則訊息。炸彈使用後即消耗。",
 "Double the Profession XP gain of every player on your world for {~} minutes. Bombs are consumed upon use.": "在 {~} 分鐘內，你所在世界每一位玩家的專業經驗獲得加倍。炸彈使用後即消耗。",
 "Double the Combat XP gain of every player on your world for {~} minutes. Bombs are consumed upon use.": "在 {~} 分鐘內，你所在世界每一位玩家的戰鬥經驗獲得加倍。炸彈使用後即消耗。",
 "Double the Soul Point gain of every player on your world for {~} minutes. Bombs are consumed upon use.": "在 {~} 分鐘內，你所在世界每一位玩家的靈魂點數獲得加倍。炸彈使用後即消耗。",
